<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Armco raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Armco raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Armco Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Armco gained 5/16 to 4-15/16.</p>
</text>
